// some printing years are made up for the prototypes.
//
// Dates: `date` is the text as a person would type it; `from` and `to` are the
// earliest and latest year (BC years negative). Anthologies get their date
// range from their contents. `datings` lists every dating of a disputed work;
// the one marked `working` is used for sorting.
//
// `cover` colors stand in for real cover photos: each book is drawn as a
// simple tile in roughly the colors of the real binding.

